  "changed": "F405 implements inert namespace XML properties through one ordinary atomic path command and the partial DAV adapter. Exact entry identity/revision,read/write/manage_paths,actual modes and current file availability protect changes and receipt recovery. Mixed XML/prefix/inherited context is retained as data;protected names and malformed/oversized requests fail atomically. COPY clones,MOVE/PUT retain and DELETE tombstones snapshots. Ordinary metadata/model context omits content;event feeds/signed snapshots redact content with its original hash. Original API-control,schema-binding and audit-content reds are retained;focused green,tagged compilation,vet,format,architecture,workflow lint and metadata stand-ins pass. Source schema63 adds a column/supplementary event guard without changing old migrations/RLS or table counts. Local retained schema35 stays untouched. Real native PostgreSQL/API/CLI/stock-curl,raw-SQL refusal,migration/restore and final-source qualification remain owed.",
